Jockington was added in '''Beta 36.0''' with the ability to draw a card every time you cast a spell. '''Beta 46.0''' nerfed it by only allowing it to trigger when casting a spell with a base cost of 2G or more. Its HP increased from 4 to 5 for this. '''Beta 50.1''' turned the condition of the effect into a keyword, named <u>Shock</u>. As such, its wording was updated, but it functions the same. ([https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Artifacts#Arcane_Scepter Arcane Scepter] gained the same treatment.)

=== Stats ===
ATK: 2

HP:
* 4 (Post Beta 36.0)
* 5 (Post Beta 46.0, Current)
Cost: 3

Abilities:
* If you cast a spell, draw a card. (Post Beta 36.0)
* If you cast a => base 2G spell, draw a card. (Post Beta 46.0)
* Shock: Draw a card. (Post Beta 50.1, Current)
** '''[Unchanged. Updated wording due to newly added Keyword.]'''
Rarity: Purple (Epic)
